blocks.en:
We compare DocLayout-YOLO with representative methods from three categories:
(1) real-time object detectors, which focus on achieving favorable accuracy–efficiency trade-offs;
(2) specialized unimodal DLA methods, which rely primarily on visual information for document layout understanding;
and (3) specialized multimodal DLA methods, which leverage additional OCR annotation and language semantic representation through vision-language modeling.
The complete list of comparison methods is summarized in Tab. S3 .

blocks.zh:
我们比较了Layout-YOLO博士与三个类别的代表性方法:
(1) 实时物体探测器,重点是实现有利的准确性-效率权衡;
(2) 专门的单式DLA方法,主要依靠视觉信息来理解文件的布局;
和(3)专门的多式DLA方法,这些方法通过视觉语言建模来利用额外的OCR注释和语言语义表达.
比较方法的完整清单摘要载于Tab。 第3条.
